A correct call outside its entry's `CELLS` is not a reason to stop: list it
under `uncertified` in your decision file, one line each naming the entry,
the values and the call site, and carry on.

Under `checks`, list each check of the unit you ran yourself, one line each:
the command, the worktree commit it ran on, and its result line verbatim. A
check you did not run is listed as not run, with why. Do not write
`UNIT_READY` over a check you saw fail.
